fxc 10.0.26100.0 (winoracle), 2026-10-27

sv_plus_user, vs_5_0 -- output signature:
  SV_Position 0  xyzw  reg 0  POS
  POSITION    1  xyzw  reg 1  NONE
  POSITION    2  xyzw  reg 2  NONE
  dcl_output_siv o0.xyzw, position

sm4_plain_position, vs_4_0 -- output signature:
  POSITION 0  xyzw  reg 0  NONE
  TEXCOORD 0  xyzw  reg 1  NONE

level9_position, vs_4_0_level_9_1:
  error X4541: vertex shader must minimally write all four components of SV_Position
  (a POSITION output does not stand in for SV_Position even at level 9)

Conclusion: the rasterizer position is the output whose SysValue is POS
(D3D_NAME_POSITION); a semantic spelled POSITION<n> is an ordinary output.
